1761:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** 
1762:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Complementary channels, break features and dead time.
